  "summary": "The River Forest Village Board approved a $50,800 purchase of 13 additional ALPR cameras from Minuteman Technologies, expanding the village's fixed ALPR network to 37 cameras, with installation expected in January 2025. The new cameras will be placed in residential areas near traffic entry points, supplementing existing fixed cameras, mobile units on patrol vehicles, and a forthcoming mobile trailer camera.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "The River Forest Police Department will install 13 additional automated license plate reader (ALPR) cameras, expanding the crime-fighting program to 37 fixed cameras throughout the village.",
      "paragraph_idx": 4
    },
    {
      "quote": "Minuteman has been the sole source provider for the department for seven years and continues to provide daily support and maintenance on their proprietary system.",
      "paragraph_idx": 6
    }
